      "side": 1,
      "message": "You must keep this final, otherwise you can crash with NPE in l.66, or return false from shouldShow when the device has FEATURE_ETHERNET. Please read the java spec chapter 17.5. Non-final members are not necessarily visible by other threads.\n\nIt\u0027s very easy to make it final with :\n\n if (...) {\n   mEthernetManager \u003d getSystemService()\n } else {\n   mEthernetManager \u003d null;\n }",
